Z||000023||JSocha||06-14-2001||02:55 PM||||Well, canceled tomorrows appointment.  I've finally had it with these clowns.<P>Went home at noon to find out the doctor wanted me to come in as soon as possible today (found out after I ate and when the wife returned home from takin care of the horses).<P>Went in, and he wanted me to go back to the lab so they could take more blood and redo the test, cause all the numbers are now on the other side of the world and can't possibly be in his opinion.  Cholestrol, tri's, sugar and a few others didn't make sense to the doctor from yesterday.  BTW, I'm registering 96 now from 313 yesterday and after exerecising and having a nice large supper lastnight before having to fast.<P>Wanted me to go to the lab then.  Informed him I just got done eating and told him where they can go and canceled my appointment.<P>My oldest step daughter goes through the same thing when she goes in for her regular blood tests to monitor her Hashimoto's or thyroid levels so they can adjust her medicine.  They end up doing her several times before they feel they get it right.<P>Told the doctor I better not be billed for today's lab or yesterdays because they obviously have a problem with their technicians.<P>Okay...I'm done!||||reg||8
